# BEGIN: xla_deps.MODULE.bazel
#
# Everything up to the matching END marker declares the JAX / XLA / LLVM
# dependency stack: pins, patches, the overrides that XLA/JAX apply to their
# Bazel Central Registry dependencies, and the module extension usages.
#
# bzlmod ignores `archive_override`/`single_version_override` declared by
# non-root modules and only accepts override patches from the main
# repository, so downstream projects consuming Enzyme-JAX as a Bazel module
# (Reactant.jl's ReactantExtra) copy this region verbatim into their own
# `xla_deps.MODULE.bazel` (which they `include()`) together with the
# `patches/` directory.  Keep the region self-contained.
#
# The commits below are updated by .github/workflows/update-dependency.yml;
# keep the `NAME = "..."` form on a single line.

